<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Healthsouth started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Healthsouth started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan said it initiated coverage of Healthsouth Corp, a provider of rehabilitative health care services, with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Healthsouth gained 3/16 to 25-1/16.</p>
